    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's an interesting way to put it, but it sounds like you're saying the 'value' of art is basically just its political utility now. don't you think that when we prioritize 'challenging power structures' over actual skill or beauty, we're basically just making propaganda instead of actual art?",
